                  "fill": "#52525B",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Planned implementation. Small typed profiles and pure functions in the shared domain library. Compose policies for each shipment and route leg; keep rendering and provider calls outside the resolver.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
